.TH SAMPLE-CONFIG 1
.SH NAME
sample\-config \- Shows the configuration.
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBsample config\fR [\fIoptions\fR]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Shows the configuration.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-format\fR \fISampleFormat\fR
Output format.
Default: Text.
.TP
\fB\-v\fR, \fB\-\-verbose\fR
Log more.
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Show help.
.TP
\fB\-\-version\fR
Show version.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
\fBconfig get\fR
Reads one key.
See \fBsample\-config\-get\fR(1).
.TP
\fBconfig set\fR
Sets one key.
See \fBsample\-config\-set\fR(1).
